e system</strong> – Loot and gear are randomized each playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game+</strong> – Keep your characters and items as the nightmare escalates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veteran Experience </strong>– Improve your attributes and learn deadly skills</p>",
        "short_description": "Evil waits behind a random mask. Choose your party of four and travel to Ashfall- a cursed town doomed to relive its suffering. Uncover its secrets, hunt the hidden boss, and forge your legacy through blood and ash.",
